      "id:\"jean-loup\",complex:!0,frameName:\"jean-loup\",spriteId:\"c2b2p1\",injectUv:`\r\n          float hair = cmap(abs(vUv.x - 0.5), 0., 0.2, 1., 0.) * cmap(vUv.y, 0.7, 1., 0., 1.);\r\n          float cheek = cmap(vUv.x, 0.1, 0.3, 1., 0.) * cmap(vUv.y, 0.5, 1., 0., 1.);\r\n          float hand = cmap(vUv.x, 0.6, 1., 0., 1.) * cmap(vUv.y, 0.7, 1., 0., 1.);\r\n          float eyes = cmap(abs(vUv.x - 0.5), 0.1, 0.3, 1., 0.) * cmap(vUv.y, 0.4, 1., 0., 1.);\r\n          float nose =  cmap(vUv.x, 0.6, 1., 0., 1.) * cmap(abs(vUv.y - 0.6), 0., .3, 1., 0.);\r\n  \r\n          dispX += hair * sin(uLocalTime * 3.5 + vUv.x * 12.) * 0.003;\r\n          dispX += cheek * sin(uLocalTime * 1.5 + vUv.x * .5) * 0.003;\r\n          dispY += cheek * cos(uLocalTime * 1.5 + vUv.x * .5) * 0.012;\r\n          dispX += hand * sin(uLocalTime * 1.5 + 0.2) * 0.02;\r\n          dispY -= hand * sin(uLocalTime * 1.5 + 0.2) * 0.04;\r\n          dispY -= eyes * sin(uLocalTime * 1.2 + 0.2) * 0.00454;\r\n          dispY -= vUv.y * sin(uLocalTime * 1.2 + 0.2) * 0.01;\r\n          dispY -= nose * sin(uLocalTime *  0.75 + 0.2) * 0.04;\r\n        `",
      "id:\"jl-tail\",complex:!0,frameName:\"jl-tail\",spriteId:\"c2b2p1\",injectUv:`\r\n  \r\n          dispX += cos(uLocalTime * 1.1544 + 0.98 + vUv.x * 7. + vUv.y * 0.3) * vUv.y * 0.02;\r\n        `",
      "id:\"city-1\",frameName:\"city-1\",texture:this.getTexture(\"c2b2p1-sprite\"),spriteData:this.spriteData",
      "id:\"city-2\",frameName:\"city-2\",texture:this.getTexture(\"c2b2p1-sprite\"),spriteData:this.spriteData",
